/ActualText (Harnessing the power of advanced computer vision technology, PhotoAI revolutionizes retail operations by providing real-time insights into store shelf images. It accurately identifies product placements, inventory levels, and planogram adherence by detecting products and their locations on shelves. Machine learning algorithms distinguish between various products, packaging types, and typical shelf arrangements. This analysis generates actionable insights for retailers to enhance shelf layouts, streamline inventory control, and maintain merchandising standards. Retailers can take immediate corrective actions by identifying these issues in real-time, minimizing lost sales opportunities, and maximizing revenue.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
