290 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Integrating PhotoAI into shelf management delivers instant compliance visibility by swiftly scanning shelf images to pinpoint and highlight potential compliance concerns such as empty shelves, misplaced items, and deviations from planograms or promotional displays. With real-time insights into these critical areas, store and field teams can expediently identify and address any compliance issues that arise to ensure that merchandising standards are consistently upheld. This proactive approach not only streamlines decision-making processes but also enables teams to optimize shelf layouts effectively, significantly boosting overall performance and customer satisfaction.)
/E (Integrating PhotoAI into shelf management delivers instant compliance visibility by swiftly scanning shelf images to pinpoint and highlight potential compliance concerns such as empty shelves, misplaced items, and deviations from planograms or promotional displays. With real-time insights into these critical areas, store and field teams can expediently identify and address any compliance issues that arise to ensure that merchandising standards are consistently upheld. This proactive approach not only streamlines decision-making processes but also enables teams to optimize shelf layouts effectively, significantly boosting overall performance and customer satisfaction.)
